  "body": "Unlock the Potential - Space, Views & Opportunity in Torbay!\r\n\r\nIGNORE THE LAST SALE PRICE!\r\nIGNORE THE CV!\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms, multiple living spaces, beautiful sea views and room to make your mark - this is an opportunity for buyers with vision!\r\n\r\nSpread across three levels, this spacious home offers a versatile layout with plenty of room for families, extended living, hobbies, working from home or simply enjoying your own space. With four bedrooms, 1.5 bathrooms, multiple recreation or rumpus areas, generous storage, a deck and an internal-access garage, there is plenty here to work with.\r\n\r\nGround Floor - Space for the Whole Family\r\n\r\nTwo bedrooms\r\nFamily bathroom\r\nSeparate laundry\r\nRecreation or rumpus room\r\nInternal-access garage\r\nAdditional storage space\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - Living with a View\r\n\r\nSpacious living area with beautiful water views\r\nSeparate dining area\r\nKitchen\r\nTwo additional bedrooms\r\nSeparate toilet\r\nOne bedroom currently features an ensuite. Please refer to the property disclosure documents for further information regarding this ensuite.\r\nStep out from the lounge onto the deck, sit back and enjoy those lovely water views - a wonderful setting to relax and unwind.\r\n\r\nTop Floor - Your Own Private Retreat\r\n\r\nThe surprises don't stop there! Head upstairs to discover another recreation or rumpus room, complete with a sundeck and beautiful sea views.\r\n\r\nImagine entertaining friends and family, creating a games room, setting up a home office or simply enjoying a peaceful workspace where you can take in the views and find your calm.\r\n\r\nNow, Let's Talk About the Opportunity!\r\n\r\nLet's be honest - this is a complete do-up. But that's exactly where the opportunity lies!\r\n\r\nForget paying a premium for someone else's renovation choices! Here's your chance to roll up your sleeves, unleash your creativity and transform this property into a home that's uniquely yours. With a little imagination, some hard work and a splash of paint, you can unlock its full potential and create a space perfectly suited to your style, vision and family's needs. A fantastic opportunity to add value, make your mark and create something truly special - all in a location you'll love!\r\n\r\nThis home deserves your attention!\r\n\r\nBring your vision. See the potential. Make it yours!\r\n\r\nContact Sid or Winston today to arrange your viewing.\r\n\r\nAll agencies conjunctional are welcome from Day 1.\r\n\r\nLink to download Harcourts Property Files https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/HAEW",
